cff-version: 1.2.0
type: software
title: "Difference-in-differences sensitivity analysis: replication and reconciliation"
message: >-
  Please cite Gibson and Zimmerman (2021) when using these replication materials,
  cite Cinelli and Hazlett (2020) when discussing the underlying sensitivity
  method, and identify the code version or commit used.
authors:
  - family-names: Gibson
    given-names: Landon
version: 0.1.0
license: MIT
abstract: >-
  Recovered replication and reconciliation materials for Gibson and Zimmerman
  (2021). Includes the documented ACS-income and revenue-per-capita spending
  specifications, enrollment analyses, sensitivity calculations, and numerical
  regression checks. Remaining reporting discrepancies are explicitly documented.
keywords:
  - difference-in-differences
  - sensitivity analysis
  - replication
  - reproducible research
  - Medicaid
